<title>BRAZIL: TENNIS-U.S. TAKE WINNING 3-1 LEAD OVER BRAZIL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-U.S. TAKE WINNING 3-1 LEAD OVER BRAZIL.</headline>
<dateline>RIBEIRAO PRETO, Brazil 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States</p>
<p>took a winning 3-1 lead over Brazil in their Davis Cup world</p>
<p>group first round tie on Sunday after they won the first reverse</p>
<p>singles.</p>
<p>Result (U.S. name first):</p>
<p>Jim Courier beat Gustavo Kuerten 6-3 6-2 5-7 7-6 (13-11)</p>
</text>
